Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:13:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: EarlyStrike opens Honor (the user: "honor
 instead of liberty because of the barb hunting")

Under EarlyStrike, while the opening book is active, the strike civ's
first policy branch is Honor (bonus against barbarians, culture from
kills, faster promotions) instead of the wide book's Liberty: the book's
early units hunt camps before the war. CP's weights choose the rest and
finish Honor first, as now. On claude/ab-c1 70f901e. Written 9:13pm ET.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
---
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp b/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp
index dfd8b0a..5b5844e 100644
--- a/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp
+++ b/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp
@@ -34702,6 +34702,12 @@ PolicyBranchTypes CvPlayer::GetOpeningBookPolicyBranch() const
 	if (!IsOpeningBookActive())
 		return NO_POLICY_BRANCH_TYPE;
 
+	// AI_AB_TEST candidate (EarlyStrike, the user's Aztec game: "i also decided to go honor instead of liberty because of
+	// the barb hunting"): the strike civ opens Honor. Its opener's bonus against barbarians and culture from kills pay
+	// while the book's first units hunt camps before the war. Without this, warmongers open Liberty (WidePlans: the wide book)
+	if (IsEarlyStrikeBook())
+		return (PolicyBranchTypes)GC.getInfoTypeForString("POLICY_BRANCH_HONOR", true);
+
 	switch (GetOpeningBook())
 	{
 	case OPENING_BOOK_TALL:
